<h1>03 · OFF 脱离、取消推迟、切断与出发 (OFF: Separation, Cancellation, Disconnection & Departure)</h1>
<p style='color:#64748b;margin-bottom:14px;'>本页共收录 <b>307</b> 个短语动词独立义项 • 已实现 <b>【单一精准中文释义 ⇔ 对应单字替代动词 ⇔ 英文特定定义】</b> 一对一严格对齐</p>
<div class="sub-nav"><button class='ctrl-btn' onclick='toggleAllSections(true)'>📂 全部展开</button><button class='ctrl-btn secondary' onclick='toggleAllSections(false)'>📁 全部收起</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterSeparability('all')">全部语法类型</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterSeparability('Separable')">🟢 仅看可拆分 (v.+O+adv.)</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterSeparability('Inseparable')">🔵 仅看不可拆分</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterSeparability('Intransitive')">🟠 仅看丕及物</button><span style='color:#99f6e4;margin:0 4px;'>|</span><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_0')">01 物理脱离、移除、脱下与擦去 (180)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_1')">02 取消、推迟、中断与下班休假 (36)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_2')">03 切断电源、隔离封锁与削减 (32)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_3')">04 出发、起飞、引爆与突然发作 (37)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_4')">05 完成交易、炫耀、斥责与圆满成功 (22)</a></div>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_物理脱离、移除、脱下与擦去 (Separation, Removal & Cleaning — '脱离表面/拿掉')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 180 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 1/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>脱下，减去，起飞</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>depart, part</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> leave<div class='ex-sent'>“The family took off for Florida”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 2/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>脱下（衣物/鞋帽）；拿掉</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>remove, doff</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> take away or remove<div class='ex-sent'>“Take that weight off me!”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 3/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>中断，妨碍，插嘴</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>interrupt, disrupt</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> take time off from work; stop working temporarily<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to take off (take time off from work).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 4/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>模仿，戏仿（某人的言行）</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>parody, impersonate</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> mimic or imitate in an amusing or satirical manner<div class='ex-sent'>“This song takes off from a famous aria”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 5/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>拿掉，减去</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>subtract, deduct</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> make a subtraction<div class='ex-sent'>“subtract this amount from my paycheck”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 6/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>取消</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>kill, prove</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> prove fatal<div class='ex-sent'>“The disease took off”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 7/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>脱下，起飞，离开</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>start, started</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> get started or set in motion, used figuratively<div class='ex-sent'>“the project took a long time to get off the ground”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>have <span class='pt-highlight'>it off</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>爱，爱好，爱慕</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>love, know</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> have sexual intercourse with<div class='ex-sent'>“This student sleeps with everyone in her dorm”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>back <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>后退</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>withdraw, retreat</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> move backwards from a certain position<div class='ex-sent'>“The bully had to back down”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 10 个核心义项'>义项 1/10</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>下来，脱下，出发</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>exit, leave</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> leave a vehicle, aircraft, etc.<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to get off (leave a vehicle, aircraft, etc.).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 10 个核心义项'>义项 2/10</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>脱下，开始</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>escape, avoid</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> escape potentially unpleasant consequences; get away with a forbidden action<div class='ex-sent'>“She gets away with murder!”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 10 个核心义项'>义项 3/10</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>引起，使产生，使遭受</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>cause</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause to be acquitted; get off the hook; in a legal case<div class='ex-sent'>“The lawyer got him off, even though there was no doubt in everybody's mind that he killed his wife”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 10 个核心义项'>义项 4/10</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>出发</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>send, transfer</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> transfer<div class='ex-sent'>“The spy sent the classified information off to Russia”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 10 个核心义项'>义项 5/10</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>a. 宽慰的，解除的，减轻的</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>relieved</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be relieved of one's duties temporarily<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to get off (be relieved of one's duties temporarily).”</div></td></tr>
