<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>tee <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>发球，开始</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>strike</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> strike a ball from the teeing ground at the start of a hole<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to tee off (strike a ball from the teeing ground at the start of a hole).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>choke <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>障碍，阻塞，使充满</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>clog, congest</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> become or cause to become obstructed<div class='ex-sent'>“The leaves clog our drains in the Fall”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>peel <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 3/5</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>飞机离队降落</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>desquamate, shed</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> peel off in scales<div class='ex-sent'>“dry skin desquamates”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>peel <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 4/5</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>削...皮，剥去...的壳，使成薄片</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>peel, flake</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> come off in flakes or thin small pieces<div class='ex-sent'>“The paint in my house is peeling off”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>peel <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 5/5</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>飞机离队俯冲目标，飞机离队降落</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>swerve, sheer</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> leave a formation<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to peel off (leave a formation).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>chop <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>斩断</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>detach, remove</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> remove by or as if by cutting<div class='ex-sent'>“cut off the ear”</div></td></tr>
