<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02_取消、推迟、中断与下班休假 (Cancellation, Postponement & Break — '叫停/推迟')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 36 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 1/5</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>使厌恶</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>repel, repulse</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause to feel intense dislike or distaste<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to put off (cause to feel intense dislike or distaste).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 2/5</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>推迟，拖延</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>postpone, prorogue</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> hold back to a later time<div class='ex-sent'>“let's postpone the exam”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 3/5</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>阻止，脱掉</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>hedge, fudge</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> avoid or try to avoid fulfilling, answering, or performing (duties, questions, or issues)<div class='ex-sent'>“He dodged the issue”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 4/5</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>阻止</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>confuse, flurry</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause to feel embarrassment<div class='ex-sent'>“The constant attention of the young man confused her”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 5/5</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>阻止，使分心</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>dishearten, discourage</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> take away the enthusiasm of<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to put off (take away the enthusiasm of).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>取消，删去，抵销</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>cancel, scratch</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> postpone indefinitely or annul something that was scheduled<div class='ex-sent'>“Call off the engagement”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>调用，呼吁，电话</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>calls</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> give the calls (to the dancers) for a square dance<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to call off (give the calls (to the dancers) for a square dance).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>cut <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 1/6</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>切断，断绝，中断</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>interrupt, disrupt</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> make a break in<div class='ex-sent'>“We interrupt the program for the following messages”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>cut <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 2/6</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>切掉，删去，切断</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>cut, interrupt</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cease, stop<div class='ex-sent'>“cut the noise”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 6/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>抵销</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>cancel, offset</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> make up for<div class='ex-sent'>“His skills offset his opponent's superior strength”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>leave <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>停止</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>exclude, except</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> prevent from being included or considered or accepted<div class='ex-sent'>“The bad results were excluded from the report”</div></td></tr>
