<details class='sub-section' id='sub_2'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>03_切断电源、隔离封锁与削减 (Disconnection, Isolation & Reduction — '切断/隔开')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 32 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 1/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>关掉，解雇，生产</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>cut, throw</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause to stop operating by disengaging a switch<div class='ex-sent'>“Turn off the stereo, please”</div></td></tr>
