<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>let <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>放出</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>excuse, relieve</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> grant exemption or release to<div class='ex-sent'>“Please excuse me from this class”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>生产，制造，使厌烦</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>repel, repulse</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause to feel intense dislike or distaste<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to turn off (cause to feel intense dislike or distaste).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 3/3</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>使转变方向，拐弯</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>turn</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> make a turn<div class='ex-sent'>“turn off at the parking area”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>close <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>封锁</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>barricade, block</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> block off the passage through<div class='ex-sent'>“We shut off the valve”</div></td></tr>
