<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>round <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>完成，把...修圆磨光</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>round, shape</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> make round<div class='ex-sent'>“round the edges”</div></td></tr>
