<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>wear <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>消失，磨损，耗损</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>wear, deteriorate</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> deteriorate through use or stress<div class='ex-sent'>“The constant friction wore out the cloth”</div></td></tr>
