<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>shut <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>设路障于，阻碍，阻塞</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>barricade, block</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> block off the passage through<div class='ex-sent'>“We shut off the valve”</div></td></tr>
