<details class='sub-section' id='sub_3'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>04_出发、起飞、引爆与突然发作 (Departure, Launching & Explosion — '离弦/触发')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 37 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 1/6</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>离开，去世，被发射</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>abscond, bolt</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> run away; usually includes taking something or somebody along<div class='ex-sent'>“The thief made off with our silver”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 2/6</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>爆炸，被发射</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>explode, burst</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be discharged or activated<div class='ex-sent'>“the explosive devices went off”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 3/6</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>被发射，进行</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>fire, discharge</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> go off or discharge<div class='ex-sent'>“The gun fired”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 4/6</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>爆炸，被发射</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>implode, collapse</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> burst inward<div class='ex-sent'>“The bottle imploded”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 5/6</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>被发射</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>happen, hap</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> happen in a particular manner<div class='ex-sent'>“how did your talk go over?”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 6/6</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>进行</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>stop, halt</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> stop running, functioning, or operating<div class='ex-sent'>“Our power went off during the hurricane”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>make <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>离开</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>abscond, bolt</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> run away; usually includes taking something or somebody along<div class='ex-sent'>“The thief made off with our silver”</div></td></tr>
