<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>head <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>阻止</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>debar, forefend</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> prevent the occurrence of; prevent from happening<div class='ex-sent'>“Let's avoid a confrontation”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 3/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>出发，引起</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>explode, detonate</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause to burst with a violent release of energy<div class='ex-sent'>“We exploded the nuclear bomb”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 4/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>加压力于，着重，重读</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>stress, emphasize</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> direct attention to, as if by means of contrast<div class='ex-sent'>“This dress accentuates your nice figure!”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 5/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>出发，开始，引起</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>begin, start</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> set in motion or cause to begin<div class='ex-sent'>“The guide set the tour off to a good start”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>run <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 1/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>逃跑，进行决赛，进行</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>abscond, bolt</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> run away; usually includes taking something or somebody along<div class='ex-sent'>“The thief made off with our silver”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 7/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>引起</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>incite, instigate</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> provoke or stir up<div class='ex-sent'>“incite a riot”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>run <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 2/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>驱散，驱逐，移置</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>dispel, displace</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> force to go away; used both with concrete and metaphoric meanings<div class='ex-sent'>“Drive away potential burglars”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>run <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 3/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>闩住，发射，脱口而出</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>bolt, leave</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> leave suddenly and as if in a hurry<div class='ex-sent'>“The listeners bolted when he discussed his strange ideas”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>run <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 4/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>流掉，进行决赛</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>compete, vie</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> decide (a contest or competition) by a runoff<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to run off (decide (a contest or competition) by a runoff).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>run <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 5/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>影印，静电复印，繁殖</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>photocopy, xerox</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> reproduce by xerography<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to run off (reproduce by xerography).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>run <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 6/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>流掉</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>waste, flow</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> run off as waste<div class='ex-sent'>“The water wastes back into the ocean”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>run <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 7/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>逃跑</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>elope, flee</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> run away secretly with one's beloved<div class='ex-sent'>“The young couple eloped and got married in Las Vegas”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>drive <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>驾车离去，驶去</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>dispel, displace</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> force to go away; used both with concrete and metaphoric meanings<div class='ex-sent'>“Drive away potential burglars”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>touch <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>触发，激起</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>trip, actuate</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> put in motion or move to act<div class='ex-sent'>“trigger a reaction”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>send <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 1/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>寄出，派遣，给...送行</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>send, transfer</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> transfer<div class='ex-sent'>“The spy sent the classified information off to Russia”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>send <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>寄出，派遣，给...送行</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>project, propel</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> throw, send, or cast forward<div class='ex-sent'>“project a missile”</div></td></tr>
