<details class='sub-section' id='sub_4'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>05_完成交易、炫耀、斥责与圆满成功 (Completion, Boasting & Success — '了结/显摆')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 22 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
