<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>pay <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 4/6</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>付清，报复，付清工资解雇</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>pay, compensate</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> do or give something to somebody in return<div class='ex-sent'>“Does she pay you for the work you are doing?”</div></td></tr>
